From: MCC45TR <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] intersect VA profiles and entrypoints with runtime Iris formats and menus

Query each codec on its coded queue before enumerating raw formats and profile
menus. Keep 10-bit and encoder support bounded by the backend implementation.
Reject unimplemented configs instead of advertising the complete static table.

